a's message of selfless kindness continues to inspire people globally.  Her humanitarian work demonstrated compassion without expecting any reward.  She championed causes like HIV/AIDS awareness and landmine abolition.  Diana's legacy lives on through her sons and charitable initiatives.  Her life proved that genuine empathy can be a powerful leadership form.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/quote-of-the-day-by-princess-diana-carry-out-a-random-act-of-kindness-with-no-expectation-of-reward-/articleshow/132632415.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/quote-of-the-day-by-princess-diana-carry-out-a-random-act-of-kindness-with-no-expectation-of-reward-/articleshow/132632415.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-07-26T00:01:18+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-132632518,imgsize-51010.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Quote of the day by Alexander the Great: "I am not afraid of an army of lions led by a sheep; I am afraid of…" - a timeless lesson on leadership, courage and the power of inspiring others]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/132632291.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Leadership quality significantly impacts group achievements, often surpassing individual capabilities.  A strong leader inspires confidence and courage, which then spreads throughout the team.  This principle applies beyond warfare to various settings like classrooms and workplaces.  Talent alone without direction yields inconsistent and often disappointing results.  Therefore, developing leadership skills remains a vital investment for any organization.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/europe/quote-of-the-day-by-alexander-the-great-